# gen-l10n 生成物（Part03 P3）——Flutter 3.47 起合成包已移除，产物随 arb-dir
# 输出到 lib/l10n/，构建时自动重生成，不入 git。
# gen-l10n outputs (Part03 P3): the synthetic package was removed in Flutter 3.47,
# so outputs land in lib/l10n/ next to the ARB sources; builds regenerate them,
# hence they are not committed.
lib/l10n/app_localizations*.dart
